  "option_id": "argon-c07-b",
  "title": "Argon C07-B (Recommended) \u2014 User Design B Perfected (Parents on Living Level & Retained Platform)",
  "subtitle": "Direct West Entry + Parents Suite + Right-Sized Kitchen (16.8 m\u00b2) & Dining (13.6 m\u00b2) + Wide Living (49.6 m\u00b2); Lower Boys + Girls + Guest Suite",
  "summary": "Directly implements the homeowner's favored Option B from redesign-0109-r5 with all 30 review & stmt-021 fixes: Main Floor features a straight, crystal-clear West Arrival Hall (zero dogleg), direct entry into the Parents Bedroom (with Private Dress and South-buffering Accessible Ensuite opening from inside the bedroom, fixing stmt-021 & I30), Walk-in Pantry (4.8 m\u00b2), right-sized South Kitchen (16.8 m\u00b2), SE Dining (13.6 m\u00b2), and a wide, generous East Family Living + NE Reading/Prayer Room (49.6 m\u00b2, 4.6\u20135.2 m wide across the entire room). Lower Floor keeps flush West Laundry (14.7 m\u00b2) & Store (11.8 m\u00b2), North-Center Wet Stack, South Row of Boys + Girls + SE Guest Suite (with Private Seated Bath fixing I10), and NE Garden Lounge (37.0 m\u00b2).",
